        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### How to read this dashboard\\n\\n`out/cpg.bin` is the authoritative Joern CPG. The Node Graph above is a bounded, regenerable sample derived from Joern's full GraphML export so the browser is not asked to render an entire repository-scale graph. Regenerate with `CPG_GRAFANA_NODE_LABELS` and `CPG_GRAFANA_EDGE_LABELS` to focus the view on specific CPG semantics. The tables count all node and edge labels present in the GraphML export, not only the visible sample."
      },
